# Harden the Docker build context against common local leak vectors.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.npmrc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage*
**/.env
**/.env.example
**/.env.prod
**/.env.dev
# OI-3 (T2): the gitignored real proxy secret lives at the repo root (build
# context = repo root via compose `context: ..`). `**/.env*` does NOT match
# `proxy-secret.env`, so exclude it explicitly so the bearer token never enters
# the daemon build context. The COPY in bedrock-proxy/Dockerfile is scoped to
# `bedrock-proxy/app/` (which never contains the secret), but this is the
# defense-in-depth backstop against a future broader COPY.
**/proxy-secret.env
bedrock-proxy/proxy-secret.env
.git
.venv

